DESCRIPTION:Whether you are flying in from many miles away or trekking acro
 ss town\, Southern Screen Festival attracts entertainment lovers and creat
 ors to see something new and learn something unforgettable. With dozens of
  films screenings\, plus an array of workshops\, panels\, parties\, and li
 ve performances\, the four day celebration every November is sure to enter
 tain\, educate\, and inspire. Let Southern Screen show you how the heart o
 f Cajun Country showcases emerging and innovative storytellers! Every year
 \, the Southern Screen Festival is honored to host some of the most intere
 sting and innovative creators from across Louisiana and the globe. Spannin
 g film\, television\, music\, podcasts and emerging media\, Southern Scree
 n welcomes professionals who can share knowledge and inspire our Southern 
 Louisiana communities Southern Screen is a multidisciplinary 501(c)(3) non
 profit arts organization dedicated to supporting and celebrating storytell
 ers across film\, music\, and the broader creative arts. Through year-roun
 d events\, workshops\, and community programming\, we provide emerging and
  established artists opportunities to develop their craft\, share their wo
 rk\, and connect with audiences. By expanding access to diverse forms of s
 torytelling\, Southern Screen strengthens the creative community and culmi
 nates this work each year with theSouthern Screen Festival in November.\n\
